      "mergedPostDetails": "I was in club Italia hub for close to two hours when the problem started.\n\nAvatars started to fail to download and load. Got stuck at 0% and never moved. Even if they tried to swap to a previously used avatar I have seen. I was still stuck trying to download the previous avatar. \n\nI could not hide their avatar and show them again to resolve the problem.\n\nAll new people joining in also got stuck at 0% download.\n\nOne person got queued for download after the first one didn't load properly. All new people didn't show as they were queued.\n\nRejoining the instance solved the problem. Everyone downloaded immediately. \n\nWould send my log. But it's 349MB, so my tab with gist or pastebin crashes. So I give you a super summarized version in a gist. Tell me how to get it to you if you want the full one.\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/Tummy-git/3c1cfbbe22e70a47a3cc949b8f82869a",
